2.01-R01", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper", text: "Track A: New Client Acceptance Path:", haystack: "M2.01-R01 Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper Track A: New Client Acceptance Path:"}, {id: "M2.01-R02", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper", text: "Mandatory questionnaires: Ultimate Beneficial Ownership (UBO), Anti-Money Laundering (AML) background check, Know Your Customer (KYC) documentation, assessment of management integrity, financial viability evaluation, independence and conflict of interest checks.", haystack: "M2.01-R02 Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper Mandatory questionnaires: Ultimate Beneficial Ownership (UBO), Anti-Money Laundering (AML) background check, Know Your Customer (KYC) documentation, assessment of management integrity, financial viability evaluation, independence and conflict of interest checks."}, {id: "M2.01-R03", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper", text: "Track B: Recurring Client Continuance Path:", haystack: "M2.01-R03 Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper Track B: Recurring Client Continuance Path:"}, {id: "M2.01-R04", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper", text: "Delta review checklist: Settlement of prior-year professional fees, key management or shareholding changes, substantial new credit facilities or loans, ongoing litigation or legal notices, reported fraud or regulatory investigations.", haystack: "M2.01-R04 Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper Delta review checklist: Settlement of prior-year professional fees, key management or shareholding changes, substantial new credit facilities or loans, ongoing litigation or legal notices, reported fraud or regulatory investigations."}, {id: "M2.01-R05", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper", text: "Mandatory Partner Sign-Off: Block project transition to operational planning until the Partner executes the digital acceptance gate.", haystack: "M2.01-R05 Dual-Track Acceptance & Continuance Risk\n                            Gatekeeper Mandatory Partner Sign-Off: Block project transition to operational planning until the Partner executes the digital acceptance gate."}, {id: "M2.02-R01", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Resource Allocation & Scheduling", text: "Visual capacity calendar tracking team availability, target utilization, and leave schedules.", haystack: "M2.02-R01 Resource Allocation & Scheduling Visual capacity calendar tracking team availability, target utilization, and leave schedules."}, {id: "M2.02-R02", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Resource Allocation & Scheduling", text: "Assign explicit roles: Engagement Partner (Approver), Audit Manager/Senior (Reviewer), and Associates (Preparers).", haystack: "M2.02-R02 Resource Allocation & Scheduling Assign explicit roles: Engagement Partner (Approver), Audit Manager/Senior (Reviewer), and Associates (Preparers)."}, {id: "M2.02-R03", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Resource Allocation & Scheduling", text: "Configure operational milestones relative to statutory cutoffs (e.g., December 31 year-end → fieldwork commences January Week 1 → draft report by February 15 → final signed report by March 15).", haystack: "M2.02-R03 Resource Allocation & Scheduling Configure operational milestones relative to statutory cutoffs (e.g., December 31 year-end → fieldwork commences January Week 1 → draft report by February 15 → final signed report by March 15)."}, {id: "M2.03-R01", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "Upon Partner risk acceptance, automatically provision the standard 5-folder engagement directory:", haystack: "M2.03-R01 Directory Provisioning Upon Partner risk acceptance, automatically provision the standard 5-folder engagement directory:"}, {id: "M2.03-R02", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "01_Administration & Planning", haystack: "M2.03-R02 Directory Provisioning 01_Administration & Planning"}, {id: "M2.03-R03", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "02_Trial Balance & Schedules", haystack: "M2.03-R03 Directory Provisioning 02_Trial Balance & Schedules"}, {id: "M2.03-R04", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "03_Fieldwork & Testing", haystack: "M2.03-R04 Directory Provisioning 03_Fieldwork & Testing"}, {id: "M2.03-R05", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "04_Drafts & Deliverables", haystack: "M2.03-R05 Directory Provisioning 04_Drafts & Deliverables"}, {id: "M2.03-R06", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "Directory Provisioning", text: "05_Final Signed Archive", haystack: "M2.03-R06 Directory Provisioning 05_Final Signed Archive"}, {id: "M2.04-R01", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Dynamic Benchmarking: Link calculation directly to ingested Trial Balance balances:", haystack: "M2.04-R01 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Dynamic Benchmarking: Link calculation directly to ingested Trial Balance balances:"}, {id: "M2.04-R02", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Normalized Profit Before Tax: 5.0% - 10.0%", haystack: "M2.04-R02 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Normalized Profit Before Tax: 5.0% - 10.0%"}, {id: "M2.04-R03", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Total Revenue: 0.5% - 2.0%", haystack: "M2.04-R03 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Total Revenue: 0.5% - 2.0%"}, {id: "M2.04-R04", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Total Assets: 0.5% - 1.0%", haystack: "M2.04-R04 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Total Assets: 0.5% - 1.0%"}, {id: "M2.04-R05", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Equity / Net Assets: 1.0% - 2.0%", haystack: "M2.04-R05 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Equity / Net Assets: 1.0% - 2.0%"}, {id: "M2.04-R06", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Core Output Calculations:", haystack: "M2.04-R06 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Core Output Calculations:"}, {id: "M2.04-R07", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Planning Materiality (PM): Base × percentage.", haystack: "M2.04-R07 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Planning Materiality (PM): Base × percentage."}, {id: "M2.04-R08", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Tolerable Error (TE) / Performance Materiality: 50% - 75% of PM.", haystack: "M2.04-R08 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Tolerable Error (TE) / Performance Materiality: 50% - 75% of PM."}, {id: "M2.04-R09", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Summary of Audit Differences (SAD) Threshold: 3% - 5% of PM (trivial error cutoff).", haystack: "M2.04-R09 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Summary of Audit Differences (SAD) Threshold: 3% - 5% of PM (trivial error cutoff)."}, {id: "M2.04-R10", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Rounding Rule: Allow managers to apply practical rounding to computed materiality values within a strict ±5.0% maximum limit prior to Partner approval.", haystack: "M2.04-R10 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Rounding Rule: Allow managers to apply practical rounding to computed materiality values within a strict ±5.0% maximum limit prior to Partner approval."}, {id: "M2.04-R11", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Visual Color-Coded Risk Stratification:", haystack: "M2.04-R11 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Visual Color-Coded Risk Stratification:"}, {id: "M2.04-R12", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Green (Low Risk): Balance below TE; standard automated audit programs; assignable to junior staff.", haystack: "M2.04-R12 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Green (Low Risk): Balance below TE; standard automated audit programs; assignable to junior staff."}, {id: "M2.04-R13", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Amber (Moderate Risk): Balance between TE and PM; requires senior substantive testing and sampling.", haystack: "M2.04-R13 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Amber (Moderate Risk): Balance between TE and PM; requires senior substantive testing and sampling."}, {id: "M2.04-R14", module: "M2", moduleName: "Administration, Governance & Planning", feature: "3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine", text: "Red (Critical / High Risk): Balance exceeds PM, involves critical accounting estimates, or carries high inherent risk; requires mandatory Manager-level execution and Partner review.", haystack: "M2.04-R14 3-Tier Materiality Calculation Engine Red (Critical / High Risk): Balance exceeds PM, involves critical accounting estimates, or carries high inherent risk; requires mandatory Manager-level execution and Partner review."}, {id: "M3.01-R01", module: "M3", moduleName: "Technical Execution & Audit Fieldwork", feature: "Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard", text: "Ingest Trial Balance files via Excel/CSV (exported from QuickBooks, Tally, Zoho, etc.).", haystack: "M3.01-R01 Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard Ingest Trial Balance files via Excel/CSV (exported from QuickBooks, Tally, Zoho, etc.)."}, {id: "M3.01-R02", module: "M3", moduleName: "Technical Execution & Audit Fieldwork", feature: "Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard", text: "Automated mapping to standardized Financial Statement Line Items (FSLI) with historical memory.", haystack: "M3.01-R02 Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard Automated mapping to standardized Financial Statement Line Items (FSLI) with historical memory."}, {id: "M3.01-R03", module: "M3", moduleName: "Technical Execution & Audit Fieldwork", feature: "Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard", text: "Split Dashboard Interface:", haystack: "M3.01-R03 Trial Balance Ingestion & Split\n                            Dashboard Split Dashboard Interface:"}, {id: "M3.01-R04", module: "M3", moduleName: "Technical Execution & Audit Fieldwork"