ndary verification. Live tenant acceptance is BLOCKED_EXTERNAL (M365-ADMIN).", "PARTIAL Release checkpoints and records exist locally. The live independent checkpoint provider is a blocked stub (\"live-provider-not-approved\"); gate P3 BLOCKED_EXTERNAL.", "NOT FOUND No DurableSharePointSyncWorker. A verified secondary SharePoint archive copy is not implemented (AUD-PLAT-03, BLOCKED_EXTERNAL).", "PARTIAL Certificate signing (CMS) exists under ADR-0016, status PARTIAL. Revocation checking was not found; eSignature providers are out of scope.", "DIFFERS Freeze deadline = report signing time + 60 days (FileFreezeService.DueAt). Local freeze and external SharePoint protection are separate states; no ArchiveLockWorker.", "DIFFERS Time is recorded by PracticeTimeService with an optional FSLI code; validation against an active approved FSLI was not confirmed.", "NOT FOUND No PracticeCalendarService or Sunday–Thursday work-week rule was found in src/.", "PRESENT Money columns use HasPrecision(19, 6) and calculators use MidpointRounding.ToEven; there is no FinancialMoneyValueObject type.", "PARTIAL End-of-service accrual uses an entered basis with no autonomous estimate; STE-NXT-014 remains PARTIAL.", ""]), Col("Source acceptance criterion", ["Reporting context activated with immutable revision pin; rejects ambiguous calendars or undefined currency", "Unbalanced trial balance rejected; control totals verified; import staged in quarantine until validated", "All active client posting accounts mapped to valid FSLI taxonomy nodes; published chart is immutable", "AJE cannot be approved by its preparer; unbalanced journal rejected; adjustments classified as recorded vs SAD", "Variance highlighted in red if exceeding tolerable error; lead schedule locked upon reconciliation sign-off", "Assets == Liabilities + Equity; Cash flow cross-casts to Cash on Balance Sheet; generated in genuine XLSX, DOCX, and PDF", "Consolidation group created with authorized entities; rejects entities outsi